Task: Based on the 5th revision (r5) of the HTAN data, list the imaging assay types available at the HTAN WUSTL center that have Level2 data and any associated higher-level data (Level3, Level4) derived from them through 'entityId' relationships in the 'id_provenance_r5' table; exclude any records where the 'Component' is NULL or contains 'Auxiliary' or 'OtherAssay'; for each imaging assay type, provide the available data levels (Level2, Level3, Level4), and do not include Level1 data or Electron Microscopy assay types.

